{"channelId":"UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","row":["Hospice Savannah",327,"Hospice Savannah, Inc. is a not for profit hospice founded by the community in 1979. We strive to provide the right care at the right place at the right time. Website https://hospicesavannah.org\n\nOur Services:\nIn-Home hospice services or at our homelike inpatient facility. \n\nCaregiver and bereavement services support for patients’ loved ones and for anyone in the community.\n\nPalliative care, a medical specialty that helps people with a variety of serious illnesses find a better quality of life. A palliative care professional works with you, your loved ones and your doctor to create a plan of care that offers relief from physical, emotional and spiritual pain, symptoms and stress. They explain your choices and ensure your needs and wishes are honored.","Info@edelcaregiverinstitute.org; CAPABLE@hospicesavannah.org","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:37.919Z","channelId":"UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e0b6f209caf05f2285744b114f6323364690950c9c4b2d8827b08f44c5eac97c","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"cf385cafbc0fe2fea644201522c23079e8ab3b604c89ef777c80fae96a428d8b"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:37.919Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":327,"raw":"327 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasacLZWCSH8B_0Y__8ydzw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:08:37.919Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"Info@edelcaregiverinstitute.org","purpose":"general","ownerRole":"unknown","identityStatus":"channel_published","sourceUrls":["https://georgiacareinnovat